  reel_script says the farmers requested to identify cattle count (கண்டறிய) but the article says cattle count and milk production via Google sheet—minor, but the reel_script also omits the request to convert the remaining amount into a long-term loan (மீதி தொகையை நீண்ட கால கடனாக மாற்ற வேண்டும்)
  reel_script states the 'Google sheet' is used to register cattle count by VAO or Aavin staff, but the article says this is to find cattle count and milk production; the draft's slides_spec 'கோரிக்கை' slide also omits the milk production aspect
  reel_script states that the 709 rupee incentive is going to middlemen as a complaint 'புகார் எழுந்துள்ளது' — the article says the incentive goes to middlemen (இடைத்தரகர்களுக்கு செல்கிறது) as a fact, not merely a complaint; the reel_script softens it to a complaint, which is a misrepresentation
  reel_script says middlemen 'ஆதாயம் பெறுவதாக' (profit), which is an interpretation not stated in the article
  caption says the Google sheet is to find 'கால்நடைகளின் எண்ணிக்கை மற்றும் பால் உற்பத்தி' and that farmers requested it, but the article says the sugarcane registration and Google sheet registration are for the VAO/Aavin registration, not that farmers requested the milk production survey
  caption states 'இதற்கு வி.ஏ.ஓ. அல்லது கிராம ஆவின் சங்கப் பணியாளர்கள் மூலம் பதிவு செய்ய வேண்டும் என்று கூறப்பட்டது' attributing the requirement to an unspecified source; the article's sentence structure is garbled so the claim about who said it is not clearly supported
  the headline states the farmers' demand is to register cattle in Google sheet, but the article describes a requirement to 'உற்பத்தி செலவை கருத்தில் கொண்டு' and does not clearly establish that this is a farmers' demand
